Subject: Cantor Self Work Update Broker B1 Npm Native Preparation P0 Data Design

@ [design_uuid] bcf57529-a45d-4ff3-a310-e58ede2f0828
@ [source_snapshot_uuid] ba57adf0-46fa-40e1-b29f-59c14f5c83f0

& [Entities]
  + SelectedExecutable binds canonical path package path package version byte counts SHA256 file identity signer and certificate thumbprint
  + PreparationEnvelope binds absent-before identity volume identity recovery owner fixed role paths and pairwise relations
  + FixtureRecipe binds deterministic directory membership canary bytes local Git file branch author committer timestamp and commit
  + SchemaGenerationRecipe binds exact argv closed environment root rights stream budgets deadline process ownership and no-substitution rule
  + PreparationResult binds pre-state post-state immutable inputs generated schema inventory process account fixture Git identities and terminal disposition

& [Relations]
  + authorization envelope contains disposable fixture container and prospective evidence root
  + disposable fixture contains candidate state SQLite canary temporary and schema roots
  + evidence root is disjoint from the disposable fixture container
  + principal workspace executable package and every D: role are pairwise disjoint
  + B1 read-only process commission may consume but never manufacture or clean a PreparationResult

& [Canonicalization]
  + path text is absolute backslash-preserving Windows text and comparisons are case-insensitive after canonical revalidation
  + file and artifact identities use uppercase SHA256 in SOP evidence and lower-case canonical SHA256 in Rust machine forms where specified
  + inventories sort by ordinal relative-path bytes and reject duplicate case-folded coordinates unknown membership reparse points and out-of-root paths
  + raw environment values remain outside evidence except fixed nonsecret path constants; admitted value identities are digests

& [Delineation]
  + preparation effects and result facts are physical hemisphere data
  + executable selection recovery ownership stop rules and later B1 nonauthority are semantic hemisphere data
  + convergence is a bounded preparation result suitable for a second final B1 SJS and nothing more
